    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A success story born from loneliness, debt, and filth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your wife left you. Your home is gone. Your life is ruined.<br>Just when everything seemed over\u2026 a flyer hit your head:<br><i>&quot;Cheap Rental: Old Bus Station Toilet&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so, <strong>Toilet Simulator</strong> began.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your New Life: Running a Public Toilet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take an abandoned, filthy public toilet and turn it into the region\u2019s top hygiene spot.<br>Clean it, decorate it, choose the toilets, even place the soap dispensers.<br>But beware: this is just the beginning.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage, Upgrade, Expand!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your own toilet empire.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new locations: from gas stations to shopping malls.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cater to your customers' needs... some are in desperate situations.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Job Full of Dangers</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pervs, thieves, lunatics, and more will invade your restroom.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Police raids, unexpected guests, and shady events await.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Install security cameras, set traps, or simply lock the door!</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Realistic &amp; Absurd Experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique mix of comedy, drama, and light horror.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every customer has a story.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Some just need to pee\u2026 some are here for other reasons.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everything Is in Your Hands</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your toilet, hire a cleaning team, and test new soap brands.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set the best &quot;WC Entry Fee&quot; in town.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or make it free and rely on donation boxes. The risk is yours.</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A success story born from loneliness, debt, and filth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your wife left you. Your home is gone. Your life is ruined.<br>Just when everything seemed over\u2026 a flyer hit your head:<br><i>&quot;Cheap Rental: Old Bus Station Toilet&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so, <strong>Toilet Simulator</strong> began.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your New Life: Running a Public Toilet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take an abandoned, filthy public toilet and turn it into the region\u2019s top hygiene spot.<br>Clean it, decorate it, choose the toilets, even place the soap dispensers.<br>But beware: this is just the beginning.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage, Upgrade, Expand!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your own toilet empire.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new locations: from gas stations to shopping malls.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cater to your customers' needs... some are in desperate situations.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Job Full of Dangers</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pervs, thieves, lunatics, and more will invade your restroom.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Police raids, unexpected guests, and shady events await.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Install security cameras, set traps, or simply lock the door!</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Realistic &amp; Absurd Experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique mix of comedy, drama, and light horror.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every customer has a story.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Some just need to pee\u2026 some are here for other reasons.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everything Is in Your Hands</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your toilet, hire a cleaning team, and test new soap brands.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set the best &quot;WC Entry Fee&quot; in town.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or make it free and rely on donation boxes. The risk is yours.</strong></p></li></ul>",
